          <item>Use part (a) to show that the series converges. i. $$\sum\limits_{n = 1}^{\infty}\frac{\ln n}{n^{3}}$$ ii. $$\sum\limits_{n = 1}^{\infty}\left( 1 - \cos\frac{1}{n_{2}} \right)$$</item>
